  "downloads": 3259,
  "favourites_count": 27,
  "description": "<p>Original Mod by JustNu : <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1022/adjustable-trader-rows#description\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1022/adjustable-trader-rows#description</a></p>\n<p>Compatibility update of Adjustable Trader Rows for SPT 4.x.</p>\n<p>Original mod by JustNU. Ive made this for myself as I have 42 traders in my game, I though the community might enjoy it awell.</p>\n<p>This is a small client-side BepInEx/Harmony UI plugin that changes the number of trader cards displayed per row.</p>\n<p>You can configure with f12 the number of traders per row that you want, on the picture it is set to 9.</p>\n<p>100% Compatible with Kaeno-TraderScrolling mod</p>\n",
